OL,3,GNEWSAPolice 'grateful' over PC Harper
OL,4,Akillers' jail terms
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice leaders have welcomed the
OL,7,Fgovernment's decision that two of PC
OL,8,FAndrew Harper's killers will be barred
OL,9,Ffrom an early release from prison.
OL,11,FHarper, from Wallingford, Oxfordshire,
OL,12,Fdied in August 2019 when the Thames
OL,13,FValley Police (TVP) officer was dragged
OL,14,Fby a car as three teenagers, including
OL,15,FAlbert Bowers and Jessie Cole, fled a
OL,16,Fquad bike theft in Berkshire.
OL,18,FMore than one million people signed a
OL,19,Fpetition calling for the pair to remain
OL,20,Fbehind bars after it emerged they could
OL,21,Fbe released as part of a plan to reduce
OL,22,Fprison overcrowding.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
