OL,3,GNEWSAPolice 'grateful' over PC Harper
OL,4,Akillers' jail terms
OL,5,
OL,6,FAileen O'Connor, the TVP's Federation
OL,7,Fchair, started the petition and said
OL,8,Fshe was "grateful" for the new
OL,9,Fcertainty over Bowers and Cole's
OL,10,Fsentences.
